From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Claude Opus 5.5" <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 02:07:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 08/39] IbashoAgent hideAvatars/getHidden: leave chosen avatars
 out of the window's frames

Hiding in the window only: hidden avatars (body, impostor, shadow,
attachments incl. rigged, attached lights, particles from them, name tag
and hover text) are skipped in renders for the window, so a screen capture
never shows them. Snapshots (gSnapshot) and impostor renders still draw
them, so the agent's own snapshots see everyone. Culling and texture
loading are untouched. Modes: off, list (hide ids), all_except (hide
everyone but me and except).
